        <mxCell id="p0-46" value="&lt;b&gt;Rules shown here&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Filter order: TraceFilter (HIGHEST+10), AuthFilter (+20), IdempotencyFilter (+30).&lt;br&gt;- Controllers and services never parse tokens or check permissions.&lt;br&gt;- No @Transactional: every service runs its work through AppTransactionManager.&lt;br&gt;- A gRPC call to another module is refused inside a database transaction (GrpcCallerInterceptor): call first, then begin.&lt;br&gt;- Stale If-Match: 0 rows updated, 412." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=12;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1710" y="140" width="380" height="250" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
