        <mxCell id="p1-33" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Interceptor orders: trace (exception slot −100), errors (exception slot), auth (+100), idempotency (+200).&lt;br&gt;- In the monolith the caller reaches the in-process server &#x27;mysms&#x27;; split, the target is &amp;lt;module&amp;gt;-service DNS on port 9112." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=12;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1710" y="140" width="380" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
